---
// Problem section + the intent-gap divergence chart (verbatim port).
---

<section class="problem-lines reveal">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem__layout">
      <div class="problem-lines__content">
        <h2 class="headline headline--section">
          AI writes more code every week. Nobody captures the intent behind it.
        </h2>
        <p>
          PRDs rot. RFCs die in Notion. The original WHY behind every feature
          fades to nothing.
        </p>
        <p>
          In 12 months, you won't be able to answer "what does our product
          actually do?" from the code alone.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="gap-visual">
        <div class="gap-visual__chart">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <!-- Grid lines -->
            <line x1="0" y1="20" x2="0" y2="210" stroke="#3a3028" stroke-width="1" />
            <line x1="0" y1="210" x2="340" y2="210" stroke="#3a3028" stroke-width="1" />
            <line x1="0" y1="70" x2="340" y2="70" stroke="#3a3028" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
            <line x1="0" y1="140" x2="340" y2="140" stroke="#3a3028" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />

            <!-- Gap area fill -->
            <path
              d="M-20,120 C80,115 160,100 240,70 L320,40 L320,200 C240,180 160,150 80,140 L0,120 Z"
              fill="rgba(212,160,84,0.08)"
            />

            <!-- Code volume line (rising) -->
            <path
              d="M0,120 C80,115 160,100 240,80 L320,40"
              stroke="#d4a054"
              stroke-width="2"
              fill="none"
              stroke-linecap="round"
            />

            <!-- Understanding line (declining) -->
            <path
              d="M0,120 C80,130 160,155 240,175 L320,200"
              stroke="#9a8a74"
              stroke-width="2"
              fill="none"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-dasharray="6 3"
            />

            <!-- Labels -->
            <text x="330" y="38" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#d4a054" text-anchor="start">
              Code
            </text>
            <text x="330" y="198" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#9a8a74" text-anchor="start">
              Understanding
            </text>

            <!-- Axis labels -->
            <text x="170" y="230" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#6a5e50" text-anchor="middle">
              Time with AI tooling
            </text>
            <text x="160" y="120" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="white" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-8, 200, 120)">
              the intent gap
            </text>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <span class="margin-note" style="left: 40px; bottom: 80px" aria-hidden="true"
    >scale 1:1</span
  >
</section>
